### Create Recent User Search

This endpoint allows the client to create a recent user search.

#### Request Body Parameters

- `search` (text): The type of search performed.

- `user_id` (text): The ID of the user performing the search.


#### Response

The response is in JSON format and includes the following fields:

- `message` (string): A message related to the request.

- `status` (boolean): Indicates the status of the request execution.


